Subject: [PATCH] Match SDK37 preference interfaces and switch ownership

The SDK37 Utils payload already uses the donor's void AlertDialog.Builder
setters; no second transformation of that owned class is needed here.

The activity no longer owns mMainSwitch. Let the Hide Developer Status
fragment own the donor's switch-and-content layout, with its existing
preference and app-picker view nested inside the native content frame.

diff --git a/smali_classes3/io/mesalabs/unica/settings/spoof/HideDeveloperStatusFragment.smali b/smali_classes3/io/mesalabs/unica/settings/spoof/HideDeveloperStatusFragment.smali
--- a/smali_classes3/io/mesalabs/unica/settings/spoof/HideDeveloperStatusFragment.smali
